; One thrown tongue. No collision shape: FlamePuff tests its own hit radius against the enemies
; group, so the shape that burns and the shape that is drawn are one number rather than two that
; drift. It draws itself (scenes/shaders/cinder_tongue.gdshader, 2026-10-29): the head out to exactly
; HitRadius, lit for exactly Lifetime, so the flame is out when it stops hurting. The five-frame sprite
; strip that used to be here was turned and scaled by the engine, which broke its art pixels.
